  "bio": "Embark on a journey of ink and art at Treasure Coast Tattoo Co, nestled in the sun-kissed town of Jensen Beach. Renowned for their mastery in traditional, newschool, and black & gray styles, our collective of artists—including the talents of @csctattoo, @erek_lanier, @brittan_puronentattoos, @highwaters_ink, @anthonyhoffman_tattoos, and @danielleliligiordano, along with PMU specialist @kate_tattoos—transforms your vision into timeless body art. Experience a welcoming atmosphere where creativity and precision converge to create your personal masterpiece.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Jensen Beach, Florida, United States"
